{"id":"fbf21d26a14b4aa1","group":"88","path":"88/88-df-post-problem.md","title":"Post Problem","display":"df-post-problem — Post Problem","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computability and Logic","book_abbrev":"88","label":"88-df-post-problem","aliases":["88-df-post-problem"],"display":"df-post-problem — Post Problem","depends_on":["[[88-df-ce-set]]","[[88-df-turing-reduction]]","[[88-df-turing-jump]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computability and Logic"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"88"},{"key":"label","html":"88-df-post-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>88-df-post-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-post-problem — Post Problem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (candidate intermediate c.e. set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}(A)\\)</span> (computably-enumerable predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b283fc95a9b1376d\" href=\"?note=b283fc95a9b1376d\" title=\"88-df-ce-set\">88-df-ce-set</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq_T\">\\(\\leq_T\\)</span> (Turing reducibility, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ceb241b03d936136\" href=\"?note=ceb241b03d936136\" title=\"88-df-turing-reduction\">88-df-turing-reduction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\emptyset&#39;\">\\(\\emptyset&#39;\\)</span> (Turing jump of the empty set, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2b6a4a081d493b4c\" href=\"?note=2b6a4a081d493b4c\" title=\"88-df-turing-jump\">88-df-turing-jump</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)\\)</span> (Post-problem witness predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}problem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\land\\emptyset\\leq_TA\n\\land\\neg(A\\leq_T\\emptyset)\n\\land A\\leq_T\\emptyset&#39;\n\\land\\neg(\\emptyset&#39;\\leq_TA)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}post\\text{-}problem} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{PostWitness}(A)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CE}(A)\n\\land\\emptyset\\leq_TA\n\\land\\neg(A\\leq_T\\emptyset)\n\\land A\\leq_T\\emptyset&#39;\n\\land\\neg(\\emptyset&#39;\\leq_TA)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Post问题询问是否存在严格介于可计算度<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\">\\(\\mathbf0\\)</span>与停机度<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0&#39;\">\\(\\mathbf0&#39;\\)</span>之间的可枚举Turing度</li>\n<li>Post问题由 Post 提出</li>\n<li>c.e. 中间度问题由 Friedberg 与 Muchnik 独立解决；Kleene--Post 的\n早期工作构造了一般的不可比 Turing 度，但不是这一定理的 c.e. 版本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-ce-set","status":"resolved","id":"b283fc95a9b1376d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-ce-set]]